OL,3,GNEWSASecond electricity cable could be
OL,4,Arunning by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second under-sea electricity cable
OL,7,Fcould be up and running by 2030 in
OL,8,FGuernsey under plans being put forward
OL,9,Fby two of the island's States
OL,10,Fcommittees.
OL,12,FThe cable would provide a new link to
OL,13,Fimport electricity from France either
OL,14,Fas a direct connection or via Jersey.
OL,15,FIt is expected to cost between #113m
OL,16,Fand #209m.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
