OL,3,GNEWSASecond electricity cable could be
OL,4,Arunning by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever States members will be asked by
OL,7,FGuernsey's Environment & Infrastructure
OL,8,FCommittee (E&I) and the States Trading
OL,9,FSupervisory Board (STSB) to approve a
OL,10,Flarger budget of up to #253m as a
OL,11,F"prudent approach" while final costs
OL,12,Fare figured out.
OL,14,FSTSB president Mark Helyar said the
OL,15,Fscheme would require "significant
OL,16,Fexpenditure" but said doing nothing was
OL,17,Fnot a realistic option.
